sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Git as Git repo (main)
    participant CI as app-ci (GitHub Actions)
    participant ECR as ECR
    participant Argo as Argo CD (in cluster)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes (next-bff)

    Dev->>Git: merge change to application/
    Git->>CI: push to main triggers app-ci
    CI->>CI: npm lint + build, Docker build, Trivy scan
    CI->>ECR: push image :commit-sha (OIDC, no stored keys)
    CI->>Git: commit k8s/kustomization.yaml newTag = sha
    Note over CI,K8s: CI is done. It never talks to the cluster.
    loop every 3 minutes
        Argo->>Git: fetch main
    end
    Argo->>Argo: live state ≠ Git → OutOfSync
    Argo->>K8s: apply k8s/ (prune + self-heal)
    K8s->>ECR: pull image :sha
    K8s->>K8s: rolling update, readiness probe /api/health
    Argo->>K8s: PostSync job GET /api/health
    K8s-->>Argo: 200 OK → Synced + Healthy

    rect rgba(250, 238, 218, 0.6)
    Note over Dev,K8s: Rollback
    Dev->>Git: git revert the deploy commit
    Git->>CI: app-ci lints/builds, no app change → no new image
    Argo->>Git: sees previous sha in k8s/
    Argo->>K8s: sync → pods roll back to old image (still in ECR)
    end
